WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.300
Wow, welcome.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.840
Welcome to the show, everybody.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:10.999
The last 24 hours in American politics are
the craziest 24 hours I've ever been involved

00:00:10.999 --> 00:00:13.360
with from the standpoint of of covering them.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:19.230
And we had, I think, six hours of live streams
yesterday in addition to the broadcast show

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:25.940
and the bonus show and almost an impossibility
to even keep up with what is going on.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:29.120
So today's show is going to be very different
than any show we've done.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.150
We are in a sense, we are winging it.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:36.649
And what I mean by that is I have about 13
or 14 different stories that I would like

00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:38.800
to talk about today.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.570
And we may get to all of them and we may not.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:46.100
In other words, I'm starting today not with
every minute planned as we normally have,

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:51.030
but with an idea of the things we should discuss
and we'll just jump into them.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:54.420
And I hope I know a lot of you have been emailing
me saying I can't keep up.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.690
Well, we we haven't been able to keep up either.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:01.260
So let's try to do justice to the last 24
hours because the historical significance

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.940
really cannot be overstated.

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:05.890
Let's start with what happened yesterday.

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:10.770
Yesterday, January 6th was meant to be the
day during which there would be a merely ceremonial

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:16.180
counting of the electoral votes which were
cast on December 14th in the November election.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:21.500
Joe Biden won the popular vote in the 50 U.S.
states, winning some, losing some, getting

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.520
enough electoral votes to become president.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:32.530
On December 14th, the electors in all 50 states
certified their states election.

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:38.440
And on January 6th, those ballots already
having been cast on December 14th, a joint

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:42.780
session of the House and Senate led by Vice
President Mike Pence as president of the Senate,

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:45.250
was to simply count those votes.

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:50.820
Now, we knew there would be some chaos because
for two months, Donald Trump has been insisting

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:57.159
without evidence that he actually won, that
it was rigged, that he wants this state to

00:01:57.159 --> 00:02:02.090
be overturned, that he wants that state to
be overturned, that there were massive dumps

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:06.310
of ballots, that Mike Pence needs to do the
right thing.

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.310
And that something.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:13.300
And it wasn't just Trump, but many of his
most sycophantic supporters who were hoping,

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:19.200
planning, believing that something would happen
yesterday that would prevent Joe Biden from

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:24.040
being determined in that joint session by
Mike Pence, the winner of the 2020 election.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:26.420
Now, I'll skip to the end.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:31.050
It happened it was delayed by a few hours,
but it happened and we will get to that.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:34.450
But what we imagine would simply be some debate.

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:39.480
We knew there would be senators and members
of the House on the Republican side standing

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:45.240
up and objecting to the counting of ballots
from certain states, Arizona, for example,

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.240
Pennsylvania and others.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:47.310
We knew that would happen.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:51.820
We expected there would be a couple of hours
of debate for each of those objections, but

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:56.090
that ultimately Republicans didn't have the
vote to hold up even a single state's votes

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:59.190
from being counted and that it might be 10
p.m.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:02.930
It might be one a.m., it might be 3:00 a.m.
it might be this morning or later today.

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:06.709
Eventually, they would run out of objections,
they would run out of votes, and that would

00:03:06.709 --> 00:03:08.150
be it.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.410
But something else happened.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:16.250
Something else happened, which is that in
the morning, Donald Trump incited an insurrectionist

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:26.650
mob to march down Pennsylvania Avenue to the
Capitol building and wreak havoc, break down

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:33.420
doors and destroy windows, commit property
crimes, fight with police, put some police

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.160
actually injured.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:39.190
And this was fomented directly by Donald Trump.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:43.910
And this is not to say that many of these
folks didn't have this idea going into yesterday

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.010
already.

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:47.349
But I am going to show you how Donald Trump
did this.

00:03:47.349 --> 00:03:53.570
Donald Trump literally told them what to do
and later said, oh, please be peaceful, but

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:54.890
we will get to that.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:57.069
Here is Donald Trump at this wacky event.

00:03:57.069 --> 00:03:58.590
I don't know what they were calling it.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.220
It was a steal the election rally, essentially.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:05.960
Here is Trump again saying, Mike Pence, you'd
better do the right thing.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.890
The left knows exactly what they're doing.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.250
They're ruthless.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:13.540
And it's time that somebody did something
about it.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:19.359
And Mike Pence, I hope you're going to stand
up for the good of our Constitution and for

00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:21.060
the good of our country.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:25.139
And if you're not, I'm going to be very disappointed
in you.

00:04:25.139 --> 00:04:29.199
I will tell you right now, I'm not hearing
good stories.

00:04:29.199 --> 00:04:33.590
Ultimately, Donald Trump ended up denouncing
his own vice president, Mike Pence.

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:35.210
And we will get to that later.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:40.180
Donald Trump continuing to fire up the crowd
by saying the caravans are forming.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:45.750
Remember those caravans that up until the
day before the twenty eighteen midterms were

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.710
every day in right wing media.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:51.780
The caravans of dangerous Hispanic immigrants
are coming.

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:52.900
Twenty eighteen midterms happened.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:56.080
We don't hear about the caravans ever again
until yesterday.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.590
Here is Trump ginning up more.

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:03.720
By saying the caravans are forming because
they know Biden will let them in.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:08.630
But now the caravans they think Biden's getting
in, the caravans are forming again.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:11.560
They want to come in again and rip off our
country.

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:12.690
Can't let it happen.

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:16.380
And then here is Donald Trump just literally
telling them what to do, saying we're going

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.340
to march up Pennsylvania Avenue, we're going
to go to the Capitol.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.060
He said he told them what to do and they did
it.

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.060
Take a look.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:27.360
We're going to walk down Pennsylvania Avenue.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:32.600
I love Pennsylvania Avenue and we're going
to the Capitol and we're going to try and

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.380
give the Democrats a hopeless.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:39.990
They're never voting for anything, not even
one vote.

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:46.120
But we're going to try and give our Republicans
the weak ones because the strong ones don't

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.530
need any of our help.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:54.161
We're going to try and give them the kind
of pride and boldness that they need to take

00:05:54.161 --> 00:05:55.870
back our country.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.820
So let's walk down Pennsylvania Avenue.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:01.100
I want to thank you all.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:04.259
God bless you and God bless America.

00:06:04.259 --> 00:06:07.949
Thank you all for being here.

00:06:07.949 --> 00:06:09.790
This is incredible.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.250
Thank you very much.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:13.479
Thank you.

00:06:13.479 --> 00:06:20.350
And that is exactly that is exactly what they
did while we were covering what I thought

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:26.700
would just be really boring debate for hour
after hour about Republican objections to

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:29.350
the counting of ballots from certain states.

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:34.410
We saw live and we saw what we had over one
point one million different people watch at

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.169
least some piece of our live stream.

00:06:36.169 --> 00:06:45.280
Yesterday, we all saw with with horror, most
of us, as the angry mob of Trump became angrier

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:51.169
and angrier, fighting with police, eventually
overwhelming law enforcement.

00:06:51.169 --> 00:06:55.919
And there are many questions about how that
happened, where where was law enforcement?

00:06:55.919 --> 00:07:00.780
And there was everything from speculation
to conspiracy theories to mere belief of incompetence.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:03.740
And at some point we will sort that out.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:07.889
Overwhelming law enforcement breaking into
the Capitol, leading to Mike Pence being taken

00:07:07.889 --> 00:07:12.320
out of their base by a Secret Service, leading
to House and Senate leadership being taken

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:17.610
sort of in protective custody or, you know,
by security to safe, safe locations.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:22.669
An evacuation of the House and Senate chambers,
protestors and mobsters and rioters, I don't

00:07:22.669 --> 00:07:27.419
even know what to call them, broke into Nancy
Pelosi's office.

00:07:27.419 --> 00:07:33.000
And they did they did exactly what would be
on the logical end of two months of firing

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:38.970
people up with lies, culminating with Trump
saying at twelve thirty pm, half an hour before

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:45.590
this all started, we're going to march over
down Pennsylvania Avenue to the Capitol eventually

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.610
after things got completely out of control.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:52.139
And I know I'm not going to get every detail
right or I'm not going to get every detail

00:07:52.139 --> 00:07:54.260
into the story.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:55.260
Discussions about do we deploy.

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:59.400
The National Guard reports that Trump resisted,
but ultimately, Mike Pence made the decision

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:00.900
to deploy the National Guard.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:05.410
Trump seemingly not wanting to deploy the
National Guard against his own supporters.

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:10.169
And eventually, Donald Trump uploaded a video
saying to people, it's time to go home.

00:08:10.169 --> 00:08:12.360
He says, you're great people.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.380
We love you.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.680
It was stolen.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:15.770
It was a landslide.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:16.780
Then we actually won.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.729
But it's time to go home.

00:08:18.729 --> 00:08:25.330
And that video was ultimately locked by Twitter,
later removed, removed by Facebook.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.069
I didn't even find it on YouTube.

00:08:27.069 --> 00:08:29.280
Unclear whether they uploaded and it was removed.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:35.710
It was a video essentially defending the feelings
and the actions, but saying it's time to go

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:41.979
home and repeating the exact same stuff that
ginned up the the anger in the first place.

00:08:41.979 --> 00:08:48.100
Trump then also tweeted basically a defense
of the rioters as he told them to go home.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:49.649
This was also removed by Twitter.

00:08:49.649 --> 00:08:54.700
Donald Trump saying these are the things and
events that happen when a sacred landslide

00:08:54.700 --> 00:09:00.270
election victory is so unceremoniously and
viciously stripped away from great patriots

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.950
who have been badly and unfairly treated for
so long.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:07.120
He is saying this is what happens when you
steal the election from me.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.790
It makes sense that this is what's happening.

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:12.770
And then he adds, Go home with love and in
peace.

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:15.750
Remember this day forever?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:22.000
Also ultimately removed from Twitter, Trump
defending the actions of the violent riot

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.510
rioters while sort of staying, saying, go
home.

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:29.690
So we're going to talk about reaction to this
and the discussion of the removal of Donald

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:30.750
Trump.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:35.100
We will, of course, cover the fact that Biden
did get the votes yesterday.

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:38.860
There are rumors that there will be more rioting
today and very important.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:43.180
There were only as of now 52 arrests yesterday,
even though there were clearly hundreds, if

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:48.470
not thousands of people who trespassed, did
property damage, attacked police, broke the

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.020
law in many different ways.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:55.890
The FBI has said it is a priority to identify
every single person who did that.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:59.980
So I'm not going to call names out specifically
on this show.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:07.380
But there are known right wing activists and
and nuts who are pictured inside the Capitol

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:11.280
and and committing crimes, trespassing, et
cetera.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.959
Let's help the FBI.

00:10:12.959 --> 00:10:16.510
There should be hundreds, if not thousands
of arrests from what happened yesterday.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.640
And there have only been 52 as of five minutes
ago.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:25.060
So let's let's actually make justice be done,
because these are folks who deserve a criminal

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.060
record.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:30.880
We talk about someone holding, you know, hold
holding a tiny amount of cannabis who ends

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:34.540
up with a criminal record and how insane that
is.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.160
These are folks who deserve criminal records.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:11:49.560
OK, so let's do what we can to make that happen.

